1
00:00:20,960 --> 00:00:23,380
♪Where can love ever be whole?♪

2
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:27,760
♪When will the bright moon be full?♪

3
00:00:28,287 --> 00:00:30,640
♪Love and hate turn on a single thought♪

4
00:00:30,680 --> 00:00:35,360
♪The past is hard to leave, part,
or sever♪

5
00:00:35,513 --> 00:00:39,040
♪My true heart has never changed♪

6
00:00:39,933 --> 00:00:42,720
♪I wish to become paired swallows
with you♪

7
00:00:43,440 --> 00:00:48,400
♪To meet year after year♪

8
00:00:52,850 --> 00:00:55,604
=Phoenix Rising from the Faint Moon=

9
00:00:55,604 --> 00:00:58,123
(Adapted from the Fanqie Novel
Heaven-Sent Consort & Scheming Prince)

10
00:00:58,123 --> 00:00:59,553
(Author: Yun Jinque)

11
00:01:01,120 --> 00:01:04,120
=Episode 15=

12
00:01:05,320 --> 00:01:06,639
Your Highness, do you mean

13
00:01:07,159 --> 00:01:10,960
for me to give myself to him?

14
00:01:12,280 --> 00:01:13,599
You want revenge.

15
00:01:13,599 --> 00:01:14,639
You want power.

16
00:01:15,079 --> 00:01:17,800
Being with him will serve you well.

17
00:01:19,320 --> 00:01:19,920
Whatever it is,

18
00:01:20,079 --> 00:01:21,840
I'll do as you instruct, Your Highness.

19
00:01:22,679 --> 00:01:23,760
Aside from comforting him,

20
00:01:24,159 --> 00:01:25,760
if he shows any sign of trouble,

21
00:01:26,360 --> 00:01:28,239
report to me at once.

22
00:01:28,599 --> 00:01:29,840
I understand.

23
00:01:31,480 --> 00:01:32,800
Oh, and one more thing.

24
00:01:33,360 --> 00:01:34,639
Du Wei doesn't

25
00:01:34,960 --> 00:01:37,639
fall for just any woman.

26
00:01:39,119 --> 00:01:40,760
That face of yours is lovely,

27
00:01:41,880 --> 00:01:43,239
I'll grant you that,

28
00:01:44,400 --> 00:01:46,280
but those legs of yours...

29
00:01:47,079 --> 00:01:47,880
Alas.

30
00:02:00,559 --> 00:02:01,960
Please don't worry, Your Highness.

31
00:02:02,679 --> 00:02:04,199
My legs...

32
00:02:09,480 --> 00:02:10,599
They're actually fine.

33
00:02:21,670 --> 00:02:24,720
(Yunlu City, Du Wei's Camp)

34
00:02:30,400 --> 00:02:30,920
General!

35
00:02:33,159 --> 00:02:34,360
General, the visitor is here.

36
00:02:35,280 --> 00:02:35,960
Bring them in.

37
00:02:35,960 --> 00:02:36,480
Yes, sir.

38
00:02:54,760 --> 00:02:56,199
(Looks like I made the right call.)

39
00:02:56,480 --> 00:02:58,800
(Mo Xuanji has raised
this many private soldiers.)

40
00:02:58,960 --> 00:03:01,400
(Her grand enterprise is within reach.)

41
00:03:01,400 --> 00:03:02,720
(Du Wei)

42
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:08,519
Ugh.

43
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:10,199
It's so inconvenient in ancient times.

44
00:03:10,800 --> 00:03:12,360
Trains and planes were so much better.

45
00:03:14,400 --> 00:03:14,800
Hmm.

46
00:03:16,400 --> 00:03:17,320
Just bear with it a little longer.

47
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:19,519
We're almost at Yunlu City.

48
00:03:19,960 --> 00:03:20,880
Fine.

49
00:03:21,920 --> 00:03:22,920
Oh, right.

50
00:03:23,960 --> 00:03:24,880
Before we left,

51
00:03:25,079 --> 00:03:26,880
Mother packed some pastries.

52
00:03:27,599 --> 00:03:29,039
Do you want some?

53
00:03:29,239 --> 00:03:31,519
You had pastries this good
and didn't bring them out sooner?

54
00:03:35,079 --> 00:03:36,960
Hmm. It's delicious.

55
00:03:38,360 --> 00:03:40,880
You said the same thing an hour ago.

56
00:03:41,480 --> 00:03:43,400
Ah. I wonder

57
00:03:43,400 --> 00:03:45,920
how Ye is doing,
all alone in Yunlu City.

58
00:03:46,360 --> 00:03:50,000
Right. So what's this
about the munitions?

59
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:54,320
Yan Qi traced a hidden shipment

60
00:03:55,119 --> 00:03:57,039
of military supplies by water.

61
00:03:57,559 --> 00:03:59,159
We followed the trail,

62
00:03:59,719 --> 00:04:01,719
and it led us to Yunlu City too.

63
00:04:01,880 --> 00:04:02,639
So...

64
00:04:03,760 --> 00:04:07,440
I suspect someone is stockpiling
supplies in Yunlu City

65
00:04:07,719 --> 00:04:08,760
and raising a private army.

66
00:04:09,519 --> 00:04:10,559
That's rebellion.

67
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:14,039
I already have a suspect,

68
00:04:14,360 --> 00:04:16,000
but no solid proof.

69
00:04:16,239 --> 00:04:19,840
That's why I'm going to look into it
myself.

70
00:04:24,760 --> 00:04:26,360
Mo Yuya, are you feeling hot?

71
00:04:27,159 --> 00:04:28,000
Why is it so hot here?

72
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:29,239
A little.

73
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:31,960
I'm sweating already.

74
00:04:36,400 --> 00:04:37,519
You're burning up.

75
00:04:42,480 --> 00:04:43,159
Pei Chen!

76
00:04:43,360 --> 00:04:44,639
Whoa.

77
00:04:45,159 --> 00:04:46,400
Is there a clinic nearby?

78
00:04:46,840 --> 00:04:48,440
We're close to Yunlu City now,

79
00:04:48,960 --> 00:04:50,239
but we're still in the mountains.

80
00:04:50,920 --> 00:04:52,519
Check for a reservoir nearby,

81
00:04:53,360 --> 00:04:55,159
or a hidden stream.

82
00:04:55,480 --> 00:04:56,320
Wait here, Your Highness.

83
00:05:01,840 --> 00:05:02,440
Weiyue,

84
00:05:02,840 --> 00:05:03,880
hold on a little longer.

85
00:05:04,039 --> 00:05:05,519
I've sent Pei Chen and Qian Ning

86
00:05:05,639 --> 00:05:06,679
to fetch medicine from a clinic.

87
00:05:07,199 --> 00:05:08,679
It's cold and remote here.

88
00:05:08,719 --> 00:05:09,679
I'll go find some firewood.

89
00:05:09,679 --> 00:05:10,199
Don't go.

90
00:05:12,480 --> 00:05:13,239
Mo Yuya,

91
00:05:14,719 --> 00:05:16,159
I want you to hold me.

92
00:05:18,079 --> 00:05:18,800
Weiyue,

93
00:05:19,239 --> 00:05:20,800
you're not in your right mind.

94
00:05:21,199 --> 00:05:23,000
You don't know what you're saying.

95
00:05:24,519 --> 00:05:27,239
Since when did you become so unsure
of yourself?

96
00:05:36,639 --> 00:05:37,840
Mo Yuya...

97
00:05:39,119 --> 00:05:40,480
You're all I want.

98
00:05:42,679 --> 00:05:44,079
You're not leaving?

99
00:05:44,559 --> 00:05:45,639
I'm leaving.

100
00:05:46,440 --> 00:05:48,280
Leaving doesn't mean
I have to stay chaste, does it?

101
00:05:49,039 --> 00:05:50,280
Celibacy is your style,

102
00:05:50,440 --> 00:05:51,159
not mine.

103
00:05:52,119 --> 00:05:53,920
There are plenty more one-night stands
in my era,

104
00:05:54,360 --> 00:05:54,960
okay?

105
00:05:55,079 --> 00:05:57,039
It's all right. I'll take responsibility.

106
00:05:57,108 --> 00:05:59,861
♪Whose face is it, after all♪

107
00:05:59,880 --> 00:06:00,599
Feng Weiyue...

108
00:06:02,039 --> 00:06:03,440
Hope you won't regret this.

109
00:06:05,173 --> 00:06:07,800
♪Rippling the pool where the moon blurs♪

110
00:06:08,796 --> 00:06:13,720
♪Where is this love meant to go?♪

111
00:06:15,935 --> 00:06:19,240
♪See the blossoms shed their fading red♪

112
00:06:19,637 --> 00:06:22,440
♪Hear the old years surge♪

113
00:06:23,406 --> 00:06:26,640
♪The bright moon shines alone
on the one I knew♪

114
00:06:26,781 --> 00:06:29,720
♪Falling into my arms♪

115
00:06:30,798 --> 00:06:33,440
♪Countless charms between your brows♪

116
00:06:34,383 --> 00:06:37,240
♪Yet you leave me battered and scarred♪

117
00:06:38,123 --> 00:06:43,720
♪Still, I call it love♪

118
00:06:44,759 --> 00:06:46,200
♪Fate's entanglement can't be severed♪

119
00:07:17,239 --> 00:07:18,760
Ah!

120
00:07:20,039 --> 00:07:24,000
You... What... I...

121
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:24,920
Where...

122
00:07:28,199 --> 00:07:29,719
What is it, Feng Weiyue?

123
00:07:31,760 --> 00:07:33,159
You don't want to take responsibility?

124
00:07:40,079 --> 00:07:41,880
You've already had me,

125
00:07:42,079 --> 00:07:43,400
so I'm holding you to it.

126
00:07:44,320 --> 00:07:45,880
You can't just abandon me.

127
00:07:58,400 --> 00:07:59,400
Over here! This way!

128
00:07:59,880 --> 00:08:00,760
Hurry!

129
00:08:05,519 --> 00:08:06,360
Hey!

130
00:08:08,239 --> 00:08:09,079
Take them away.

131
00:08:15,960 --> 00:08:16,720
Mo Yuya,

132
00:08:17,439 --> 00:08:20,640
didn't we... you know,
do that last night?

133
00:08:20,960 --> 00:08:22,399
Is that a crime here?

134
00:08:22,520 --> 00:08:23,800
General Du, they were the ones

135
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:25,279
sneaking around in the dead of night

136
00:08:25,560 --> 00:08:27,760
on our training grounds.
Very suspicious.

137
00:08:28,920 --> 00:08:30,720
Wait, we're innocent, General.

138
00:08:36,239 --> 00:08:37,840
We've done nothing wrong, General.

139
00:08:38,199 --> 00:08:40,840
We're just ordinary folk
from Yunlu City.

140
00:08:41,560 --> 00:08:43,920
Last night we got carried away,

141
00:08:44,399 --> 00:08:47,760
wandered onto your grounds
and spent the night there.

142
00:08:49,199 --> 00:08:50,760
We weren't after anything else.

143
00:08:58,640 --> 00:09:00,680
Nothing else at all.

144
00:09:01,039 --> 00:09:02,319
So have a heart

145
00:09:02,319 --> 00:09:02,920
and let us...

146
00:09:03,239 --> 00:09:04,119
Ouch, it hurts!

147
00:09:04,119 --> 00:09:05,279
Let us go.

148
00:09:05,920 --> 00:09:07,520
Ordinary folk?

149
00:09:08,720 --> 00:09:11,600
But this boy has soft, fair skin

150
00:09:12,199 --> 00:09:13,479
and carries himself like a noble.

151
00:09:14,279 --> 00:09:16,159
He's no ordinary commoner.

152
00:09:19,199 --> 00:09:21,279
Prince of Rong is a man
of extraordinary talent.

153
00:09:21,399 --> 00:09:23,880
Even rough cloth can't hide
that royal bearing.

154
00:09:26,039 --> 00:09:28,439
You mean he's the Sixth Prince,

155
00:09:28,720 --> 00:09:29,520
Prince of Rong?

156
00:09:32,800 --> 00:09:33,720
The very same.

157
00:09:34,119 --> 00:09:35,079
General Du,

158
00:09:35,279 --> 00:09:36,239
I was once

159
00:09:36,239 --> 00:09:38,800
close to Prince of Rong
in our younger years.

160
00:09:39,039 --> 00:09:39,960
I would never mistake him.

161
00:09:40,359 --> 00:09:41,880
What are you doing here?

162
00:09:43,640 --> 00:09:44,399
Your leg

163
00:09:44,680 --> 00:09:45,479
is healed?

164
00:09:49,760 --> 00:09:50,960
Have you ever considered

165
00:09:51,279 --> 00:09:54,840
that my leg was never lame?

166
00:09:55,880 --> 00:09:57,159
So it was all an act.

167
00:10:00,239 --> 00:10:02,319
I never laid a hand on you
three years ago,

168
00:10:02,560 --> 00:10:04,319
yet you kept up the act
for three whole years,

169
00:10:04,640 --> 00:10:06,479
just to win Mo Yuya's sympathy

170
00:10:06,680 --> 00:10:08,039
and turn him against me.

171
00:10:10,319 --> 00:10:11,239
Feng Weiyue,

172
00:10:11,720 --> 00:10:13,319
when you schemed against me
and humiliated me,

173
00:10:13,680 --> 00:10:15,920
did you ever think this day would come?

174
00:10:23,800 --> 00:10:25,000
Yuya,

175
00:10:25,479 --> 00:10:28,439
my feelings for you have never changed.

176
00:10:29,159 --> 00:10:31,479
If you would just cast Feng Weiyue
aside,

177
00:10:31,800 --> 00:10:34,640
I could still put in a good word
for you.

178
00:10:35,159 --> 00:10:36,680
Feng Qingyun,

179
00:10:37,079 --> 00:10:38,560
it's not too late to turn back.

180
00:10:39,279 --> 00:10:41,159
Don't keep repeating your mistakes.

181
00:10:42,680 --> 00:10:44,079
Fine.

182
00:10:44,439 --> 00:10:46,399
Just terrific.

183
00:10:48,680 --> 00:10:50,840
Since you don't know
what's good for you...

184
00:10:54,439 --> 00:10:55,600
General Du,

185
00:10:56,319 --> 00:11:00,439
Prince of Rong holds power at court

186
00:11:00,760 --> 00:11:02,319
and shares power
with the Grand Princess.

187
00:11:03,039 --> 00:11:04,600
His coming here

188
00:11:04,600 --> 00:11:05,600
is no coincidence.

189
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:07,119
You had best

190
00:11:07,119 --> 00:11:08,960
keep him under close guard here

191
00:11:09,239 --> 00:11:11,680
and send for the Grand Princess
to decide.

192
00:11:12,520 --> 00:11:13,960
As for this woman,

193
00:11:15,600 --> 00:11:17,319
I'd like to ask you for her

194
00:11:17,600 --> 00:11:19,039
as a plaything.

195
00:11:20,319 --> 00:11:21,399
Play with her all you like,

196
00:11:22,119 --> 00:11:23,359
but don't let her get away.

197
00:11:23,880 --> 00:11:25,359
Rest assured, General.

198
00:11:27,319 --> 00:11:28,439
Let go of me!

199
00:11:34,359 --> 00:11:35,279
My dear sister,

200
00:11:35,880 --> 00:11:38,920
enjoy your last few comfortable days.

201
00:11:39,600 --> 00:11:41,119
Feng Qingyun, what do you mean by that?

202
00:11:41,560 --> 00:11:43,079
We did this to you?

203
00:11:43,600 --> 00:11:45,760
Your mother brought her death
on herself.

204
00:11:46,359 --> 00:11:47,880
You could have stayed at Feng Manor,

205
00:11:48,119 --> 00:11:49,079
yet you ran off here to be a camp whore?

206
00:11:49,079 --> 00:11:49,920
Shut your mouth!

207
00:11:50,119 --> 00:11:50,880
Feng Weiyue,

208
00:11:51,359 --> 00:11:52,680
what right do you have to speak?

209
00:11:53,159 --> 00:11:55,000
You're the one
who caused my mother's death.

210
00:11:55,640 --> 00:11:56,399
With her dead,

211
00:11:56,880 --> 00:11:59,000
there's no place left for me
in all of Feng Manor.

212
00:11:59,640 --> 00:12:02,239
And Mo Yuya gave his heart to you
completely.

213
00:12:02,800 --> 00:12:04,279
I have nothing left.

214
00:12:04,600 --> 00:12:06,439
Can you honestly say
none of this is your doing?

215
00:12:06,800 --> 00:12:07,800
Hey, Ms. Unreasonable,

216
00:12:08,399 --> 00:12:09,960
you can't put it that way.

217
00:12:09,960 --> 00:12:11,319
That's just how this world works.

218
00:12:11,880 --> 00:12:13,199
There's no fairness in it.

219
00:12:13,439 --> 00:12:15,119
You laugh at me for being a camp whore,

220
00:12:15,439 --> 00:12:16,720
but even at my lowest,

221
00:12:17,000 --> 00:12:19,039
I serve only one man.

222
00:12:19,399 --> 00:12:20,239
As for you,

223
00:12:21,079 --> 00:12:22,520
my dear sister,

224
00:12:23,279 --> 00:12:24,720
tomorrow, you'll...

225
00:12:30,399 --> 00:12:31,880
Feng Qingyun, what do you mean?

226
00:12:49,160 --> 00:12:52,040
♪Dazzling my eyes, impossible to clear♪

227
00:12:52,247 --> 00:12:54,560
♪Mist and clouds lock the frosty sky♪

228
00:12:56,200 --> 00:12:58,600
♪Moon waxes and wanes,
true and false blur♪

229
00:12:59,087 --> 00:13:01,407
♪Coming near, then drifting far♪

230
00:13:02,393 --> 00:13:05,400
♪My heart knows it three thousand times♪

231
00:13:05,967 --> 00:13:08,200
♪Flowers mirrored in clear
shallow water♪

232
00:13:09,333 --> 00:13:13,813
♪Black hair spinning a cocoon,
I step toward love's abyss♪

233
00:13:16,680 --> 00:13:19,080
♪Sword in hand, I spur my horse on♪

234
00:13:19,713 --> 00:13:22,400
♪Love and duty cannot both be whole♪

235
00:13:23,574 --> 00:13:26,200
♪Troubles within and without,
home and realm in peril♪

236
00:13:26,553 --> 00:13:28,760
♪Scattered before my eyes♪

237
00:13:30,000 --> 00:13:32,920
♪Wind and snow cannot blow away
my longing♪

238
00:13:33,273 --> 00:13:35,640
♪Letting go is a kind of fulfillment♪

239
00:13:36,320 --> 00:13:37,560
♪This love remains unchanged♪

240
00:13:37,560 --> 00:13:41,080
♪Yet under the moon I make empty wishes♪

241
00:13:42,813 --> 00:13:45,253
♪Ask not of love's poison,
yearning cannot be cut♪

242
00:13:45,360 --> 00:13:49,320
♪In the mortal world jade shatters,
tears of blood run dry♪

243
00:13:49,720 --> 00:13:52,120
♪Ask again of love's poison,
in whose arms will I sleep♪

244
00:13:52,280 --> 00:13:54,020
♪How can I bear a sweet dream♪

245
00:13:54,020 --> 00:13:55,760
♪Turning into doom♪
(Wedding)

246
00:13:56,520 --> 00:13:59,120
♪A path full of thorns,
time won't wait♪

247
00:13:59,120 --> 00:14:03,440
♪I fear this life won't grant us
tender days together♪

248
00:14:03,920 --> 00:14:05,800
♪I don't regret that vow♪

249
00:14:06,000 --> 00:14:09,280
♪Luckily, the phoenix has fallen
into my heart♪
